## Sushi Project Delivery App
### (Ongoing Project)

**Author:** Nakashima, Hiromi and Nakashima, Caio

App created to optimize orders from a delivery business. The goal is to provide an automatic way to write orders to a database, relating to a fixed client table and a flexible product table. Intended for internal business use.

---

### Project Architecture

![Project Architecture](info/Project_Notes.drawio.png)

The deployment concept is based on:
**local dev** → [Docker image build](https://dev.to/dentrodailha96/leanings-docker-and-it-perks-33if) → push to GitHub → [Actions triggers](https://dev.to/dentrodailha96/connecting-docker-to-digital-ocean-droplet-using-git-actions-5k0) → image pushed to Container Registry → [Droplet](https://dev.to/dentrodailha96/learning-creating-a-ubuntu-droplet-4o7g) pulls and runs.

---

### Tech Stack

PHP, HTML, Docker, Apache, NEON (PostgreSQL), DigitalOcean Droplet (Ubuntu 24.04), GitHub Actions CI/CD, Container Registry.


